{"speciesId":732,"names":{"fr":"Piclairon","es":"Trumbeak","en":"Trumbeak","ja":"ケララッパ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il garde toujours dans son bec les pépins des fruits qu’il mange, ce qui lui permet de faire feu dès qu’un ennemi se présente."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Almacena en su pico las semillas de las bayas de las que se alimenta para usarlas como arma contra enemigos y posibles presas."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It eats berries and stores their seeds in its beak. When it encounters enemies or prey, it fires off all the seeds in a burst."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"クチバシに 喰った きのみの タネを 溜め込む。 敵や 獲物に 出会うと 一気に 発射する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"En déformant son bec, il peut produire une ribambelle de sons différents, plus bruyants les uns que les autres. Le cauchemar des voisins."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Puede deformar su pico para producir los sonidos más diversos. Debido al estruendo que crea, se granjea la enemistad de sus vecinos."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"By bending its beak, it can produce a variety of calls and brand itself a noisy nuisance for its neighbors."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"クチバシを 反り返らせ 色んな 音で 鳴く。 かなり うるさいので 周りの 御宅には 嫌われるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Ce Pokémon est capable de produire plus de cent sons différents en recourbant le bout de son bec."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Al torcer la punta del pico es capaz de emitir a su antojo más de 100 graznidos diferentes."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It can bend the tip of its beak to produce over a hundred different cries at will."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"クチバシの 先端を 反り返らせ １００ 以上の 鳴き声を 自由に 鳴きわけることが できる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il crache violemment les noyaux des Baies qu’il a mangées. Ils s’éparpillent au sol et donnent naissance à de nouvelles plantes."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Dispara por el pico las semillas de las bayas ingeridas. Al dispersarse por el suelo, de ellas acaban germinando nuevas plantas."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"From its mouth, it fires the seeds of berries it has eaten. The scattered seeds give rise to new plants."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"食べた きのみのタネを 口から 発射。 タネは大地に 散らばり 新たな 草木が 生まれるのだ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":732,"moves":[{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fly","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fury-attack","learns":[[17,"level-up",24],[18,"level-up",24],[25,"level-up",24]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"growl","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",3],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",3],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"supersonic","learns":[[17,"level-up",13],[18,"level-up",13],[25,"level-up",13]]},{"name":"peck","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"drill-peck","learns":[[17,"level-up",32],[18,"level-up",32],[25,"level-up",32]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"screech","learns":[[17,"level-up",29],[18,"level-up",29],[25,"level-up",29]]},{"name":"double-team","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"swift","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"sky-attack","learns":[[18,"tutor",0],[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"rest","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"substitute","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thief","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"snore","learns":[[18,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"protect","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"endure","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"swagger","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"steel-wing","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[1